<title>CHINA: China to take 46 pct in 100-seater plane venture.</title>
<headline>China to take 46 pct in 100-seater plane venture.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aviation Industries of China (AVIC) announced on Tuesday that it would take a 46 percent stake in a ambitious project to build a 100-seat airliner, the official Xinhua news agency said.</p>
<p>The European consortium Aero International Asia, which includes British Aerospace and France's Aerospatiale, will take a 39 percent stake with the remaining 15 percent taken by Singapore Technologies Aerospace, it said.</p>
</text>
